ltra-Lobster", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "74c51acaa09f65854150d4e652481fc9e1153cdd", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2023-02-14T21:14:29Z", "repo": "Ultra-Lobster", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "77aceb5904da90649fa08f55c4aa73b984bb0343", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2023-02-14T21:06:55Z", "repo": "Ultra-Lobster", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f8669318246c81443c10b3ebecd0eed33848c201", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2023-02-14T20:41:00Z", "repo": "Ultra-Lobster", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "815fb976a7649151c974a8ffd939d3dade6ea3d9", "message": "Small fix for Dark mode in light theme\n\nObsidian dark theme was applying colorway to light mode, this push should fix that :)", "created_at": "2023-02-11T17:04:07Z", "repo": "Ultra-Lobster", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3870f0caee4983dc13e900d802ee35bebe48598b", "message": "u 1.0", "created_at": "2023-02-11T06:41:08Z", "repo": "Ultra-Lobster", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1a805311d5c7513a88c05c51805addf81d717292", "message": "Update 1.0\n\nUpdate 1.0 not only brings tons of new options to style settings, but finally brings Ultra Lobster out of beta! It's been a long journey, but with this refactoring I finally consider the theme stable enough for daily use. Special care was taken to go through and comment pretty much all of my code, and I was able to trim off about 2k lines! While this update does make the theme far more readable on the code side, I am mostly excited about how easily it allows me to add new features! There is a ton baked into this update, from many new animations, to color palettes, and loads of custom (and experimental!) features within Style Settings. There is still a lot of work to be done, but for now I am beyond excited to announce Ultra Lobsters most polished update yet, Monolithic Muntjac.", "created_at": "2023-02-11T06:39:00Z", "repo": "Ultra-Lobster", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f8d468d60d0901a2079de4f08db8e735b4318c2a", "message": "Sneaky color scheme update \ud83d\udc08\u200d\u2b1b\n\nAdded back several color schemes, including a solarized #15, amoled, Gruvbox, Dracula, and Trans Pride sub-themes.\r\nRedid Style Settings for Lemmons incredible new Markdown syntax to prepare for more options in the future\r\nAdded and changed several animations around the UI, let me know what you think!\r\n\u2728 NuMeRoUs BuG fIxEs AnD iMpRoVmEnTs \u2728\r\nProbably other stuff but I suck at writing changelogs", "created_at": "2023-02-07T03:11:44Z", "repo": "Ultra-Lobster", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b901b8e451d79b587f781d078135b3ef63309013", "message": "Fix for callout clamping", "created_at": "2023-02-04T20:17:08Z", "repo": "Ultra-Lobster", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "21edf51b19f23500fb1d748c00baa62353957961", "message": "u.b.9", "created_at": "2023-02-03T17:13:30Z", "repo": "Ultra-Lobster", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4fa127bb6a8955beaf6527a712c1a17a5ab066cb", "message": "Changed name of gradient mode\n\nChanged name from 'aura mode' to \"halo mode\" to avoid any confusion with the wonderful [Aura Theme](https://github.com/ashwinjadhav818/obsidian-aura)", "created_at": "2023-02-03T17:07:14Z", "repo": "Ultra-Lobster", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "22cdebd45fb1b9f894f4666842955a0ee2c62254", "message": "u.b.9", "created_at": "2023-02-03T06:11:03Z", "repo": "Ultra-Lobster", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ed68345d56530ede8262fb68dfa472ba